# Module: Fees Management

## Scope

Fee categories/structures, class assignment, invoice generation, manual payment collection, receipts, outstanding dues.

## Key Entities

`FeeCategory`, `FeeStructure`, `FeeStructureItem`, `ClassFeeAssignment`, `FeeInvoice`, `FeeInvoiceItem`, `FeePayment`, `FeeReceipt`, `StudentFeeAccount`

## Permissions

```
fees.structure.manage
fees.invoices.create
fees.invoices.read
fees.invoices.cancel
fees.payments.collect
fees.concessions.apply
fees.concessions.approve
fees.reports.read
```

## Commands (MVP)

- `CreateFeeCategoryCommand`, `CreateFeeStructureCommand`, `AssignFeeStructureToClassCommand`
- `GenerateFeeInvoicesCommand` — bulk for class/term
- `CancelFeeInvoiceCommand`
- `RecordFeePaymentCommand`, `VoidFeePaymentCommand`
- `ApplyConcessionCommand`, `ApproveConcessionCommand`

## Business Rules

- Invoice number: `{TENANT_PREFIX}-{YEAR}-{SEQ}` — sequential, no gaps on void (mark void, don't reuse)
- Payment amount cannot exceed outstanding balance (`PaymentAmountNotExceedingDueValidator`)
- Duplicate payment reference rejected (`DuplicatePaymentReferenceValidator`)
- Receipt number sequential per tenant
- Void payment creates reversal entry, not delete

## Invoice Status

`Draft → Issued → PartiallyPaid → Paid | Overdue | Cancelled`

## Events

- `FeeInvoiceGeneratedIntegrationEvent`
- `FeePaymentReceivedIntegrationEvent` → notification + Phase 2 accounting hook
- `FeeOverdueIntegrationEvent` → reminder notification

## Money

- All amounts `decimal(18,2)`
- MVP: manual/cash payments only — no payment gateway

## Queries

- `ListFeeInvoicesQuery`, `GetStudentFeeLedgerQuery`, `GetOutstandingDuesQuery`
- `GenerateFeeReceiptPdfQuery`

## Parent Scope

- Parents read invoices/ledger for linked children only
